{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1000_021mat", "source_sha256": "639b41c34a9895e5b93c88239ced1fac85d3d2a44579ba33fbe3cd16caa0048a", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまなのです！\n今日のステージ、とっても楽しかったのです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n今天的舞台特别开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ebb231420460edfb556d03d73a7eff4f38a9d4c890669e95c094773b3776aede", "ja": "お疲れさま、スチームパンクがテーマって言うのが、\n新鮮だったよな。まつり、好きだったんだっけ？", "zh": "辛苦了，以蒸汽朋克为主题，确实让人觉得很新鲜。小祭喜欢这个来着，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "34a829131da94b89e6597614260181d27fb41887855a9b116b4cab761508efc1", "ja": "はいなのです。夢と蒸気とロマンの溢れる、\n姫が夢中になった世界に、みんなをご招待！なのです。", "zh": "是的哦。现在就邀请大家来到这个充满梦想、蒸汽与浪漫，令公主深深着迷的世界！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1003_p", "source_sha256": "3f6fdbe3e03645c48ae502b5b1e4e674504a4807f841128e7c8bfc26f01630f7", "ja": "確かに飛行船とか、蒸気機関とか……\nそういう世界観には憧れるかもな。", "zh": "确实，飞艇啊、蒸汽机啊……\n对那种世界观还是挺向往的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1004_021mat", "source_sha256": "61457515c88dc965f12539cfd77ae378440b51a9bb5e5c0884a3db1630d01b11", "ja": "そうなのです！　姫は、いつもスチームパンクマンガを\n読むときに、考えてしまうのです……。", "zh": "就是这样！每次读蒸汽朋克漫画时，人家都会忍不住想……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1005_021mat", "source_sha256": "09ca980371ab01af8534bd9e66f8efa320139b147e160055cbb126e3018ba988", "ja": "{$P$}さんや、アイドルのみんなと\nこんな世界を冒険できたら楽しいだろうなって。", "zh": "要是能和{$P$}先生，还有各位偶像\n一起在这样的世界里冒险，一定会很开心的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f8b4a84c768a8c02e04d6b53ad48f0c2c82c019618c771b550e76e47f50e761a", "ja": "はは、それは楽しそうだな。まつりはきっと、\nスチームパンクの世界でも姫なんだろうけど。", "zh": "哈哈，听起来一定很有意思。虽然茉莉在蒸汽朋克的世界里肯定也还是公主吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_021mat0272_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_021mat0272_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "e44a92b671aa804e1cf95a4942e83af42f1829bc4fa0a5855a74ea851b7efd0a", "ja": "もちろん、姫はどんな世界でも姫なのです♪\n……でも。", "zh": "当然啦，公主无论在哪个世界都是公主哦♪\n……不过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
